1
00:00:00,469 --> 00:00:01,899
(Amy:)Look, I know you
don't like it,

2
00:00:01,903 --> 00:00:03,473
(Amy:)but that's the point
of the experiment.

3
00:00:03,472 --> 00:00:04,972
(Amy:)I need to irritate you

4
00:00:04,973 --> 00:00:07,403
(Amy:)to find your optimal
anxiety zone.

5
00:00:07,409 --> 00:00:09,779
(Amy:)And you said no to
tickling, polka music

6
00:00:09,778 --> 00:00:12,078
(Amy:)or watching me
eat a banana.

7
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,650
(Sheldon:)Who eats them
horizontally?!

8
00:00:16,117 --> 00:00:18,187
(Amy:)My mother said that's
how good girls do it.

9
00:00:22,591 --> 00:00:24,591
(Sheldon:)Perhaps this was
a waste of time.

10
00:00:24,593 --> 00:00:26,423
(Leonard:)Sheldon,

11
00:00:26,428 --> 00:00:28,428
(Amy:)you're a remarkable scientist.

12
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:30,600
(Amy:)Just be patient-- I'm sure
you'll find the breakthrough

13
00:00:30,599 --> 00:00:31,969
(Amy:)you've been looking for.

14
00:00:31,967 --> 00:00:33,437
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

15
00:00:33,435 --> 00:00:35,265
(Amy:)And if you only
do solid research

16
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:38,270
(Amy:)instead of making
a groundbreaking discovery,

17
00:00:38,273 --> 00:00:39,673
(Amy:)what does it matter?

18
00:00:39,674 --> 00:00:42,104
"Only do solid research"?!

19
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:45,110
Uh... I come to you for help,
and you insult me?!

20
00:00:45,113 --> 00:00:47,283
(Sheldon:)I thought the least that
you would do would be...

21
00:00:47,282 --> 00:00:49,112
(Amy:)Look, your anxiety levels
are right in the zone.

22
00:00:49,117 --> 00:00:50,517
(Sheldon:)Really?

23
00:00:50,519 --> 00:00:52,119
(Sheldon:)Oh, that's fantastic.

24
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,450
N-Now, wait,
they're dropping.

25
00:00:53,455 --> 00:00:54,455
(Sheldon:)Why are they dropping?

26
00:00:54,456 --> 00:00:56,526
(Amy:)Because you're happy
they're elevated.

27
00:00:56,525 --> 00:00:58,325
Oh, that is infuriating!

28
00:00:58,326 --> 00:00:59,696
(Sheldon:)Ooh, look, they went
back up again.

29
00:00:59,694 --> 00:01:00,694
(Sheldon:)Terrific.

